# Veripsa release gate (auto-discovered). One gate per file -> two PRs adding gates add two FILES, never a
# shared line -> no false merge conflict on registration. register_gate is defined in run_gates.sh.
# Format: register_gate <test> <marker> <name> <ok_blurb> <desc> [tail]
register_gate "tests/test_extractor_js_prototype.py" "JS-PROTOTYPE GATE: PASS" "JS prototype-assignment extractor: member assignments with function RHS emit def nodes" "JS prototype-assignment extractor emits def nodes for assignment_expression whose LHS is a member_expression and RHS is a function value, as measured on express lib/ files (BEFORE: 19 def nodes in lib/, AFTER: 71). Real method names (set/use/route/handle/render/listen/status/send/json/redirect) now appear as symbol-level defs instead of being invisible, restoring finer-collision precision for Express/Connect-style libraries without minting junk from inline callbacks or non-function assignments." "JS prototype extractor: fixture with app.set=function/proto.route=function/proto.get=arrow yields def nodes set/use/route/get/is; inline callbacks and non-function assignments (obj.flag=true) produce no def; all prototype defs carry start_line span. Applies to the typescript-family extractor path covering .js/.ts/.jsx/.tsx files." 12
